00:08:52.709 --> 00:08:53.709
Teenage Years
Growing up, Hans would have no way of knowing

00:08:53.709 --> 00:08:54.709
that despite all of the horrible things he
went through, he was extremely lucky.

00:08:54.709 --> 00:08:55.709
There were very few Afro-Germans living in
the country during the war.

00:08:55.709 --> 00:08:56.709
Since Germany had colonized parts of Africa,
exterminating them from their mainland was

00:08:56.709 --> 00:08:57.709
a low priority compared to the Jews and Roma.

00:08:57.709 --> 00:08:59.590
However, a German anthropologist called Dr.
Wolfgang Abe released a study that concluded

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:03.500
that mixed race children were genetically
inferior to pure Aryans.

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:07.420
He said that they were aggressive and dangerous,
and that their mothers were basically just

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:10.910
incubators for an alien race that wasn’t
fully human.

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:14.930
He believed that it was necessary to sterilize
all mixed-race people who were left living

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:16.050
in Germany.

00:09:16.050 --> 00:09:20.260
Many Afro and Asian-German people were caught
by the SS, and they were forced to undergo

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:24.380
surgeries that would sterilize them so that
they could no longer have children and pass

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:25.630
on their DNA.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:29.690
Hans Massaquoi was able to avoid this fate,
because the authorities knew that he was a

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:33.410
prince, and he was protected under a sort
of diplomatic immunity.

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:37.240
When he became a teenager, Hans found out
that even though he was a full German citizen,

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:40.970
the Nazi laws prevented him from having any
hope of a successful future.

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:45.060
Since he was non-Aryan, Hans was not allowed
to pursue higher education, so his dreams

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:49.000
of getting an engineering degree and designing
bridges was crushed.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:52.360
He tried to enlisted in the German army after
graduating High School, but he was denied

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:54.520
entry, because of his race.

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:57.820
Non-Aryans were not allowed to hold a job
and earn an income, either.

00:09:57.820 --> 00:10:01.810
The Nazi government made sure that he was
left with almost no hope of having any kind

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:03.630
of life after High School.

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:07.050
Thankfully, a local blacksmith took him under
his wing as an apprentice.

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:10.930
After learning his craft, he went to a job
counselor to see if he could get a work assignment.

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:14.560
He did not expect much to happen, since he
knew that he was not allowed to work, but

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:17.770
he showed up with examples of the things that
he had created during his apprenticeship.

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:21.970
He hoped that maybe they would see his skill,
and make an exception to the rules.

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:25.550
The SS officer looked over his papers, and
told him that he could not give him a job,

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:29.680
but someday soon, he believed that Hitler
would help Germany retake their colonies in

00:10:29.680 --> 00:10:32.760
Africa, and they would need a loyal black
man like him to help them.

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:36.530
Hans began dating a white girl for a short
period of time, and he took her dancing at

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:41.090
night clubs that played American swing music,
which had been banned by the Nazi government.

00:10:41.090 --> 00:10:45.300
He was taking a lot of risks, especially since
this girl’s father was an SS officer.

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:46.950
They had to meet in secret at night.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:50.310
One evening, he was caught, and brought in
to the police station.

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:54.470
Dating a white girl was violating the Nuremberg
Laws, and to make matters worse, the police

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:57.580
officers that picked him up claimed that he
was trying to mug her.

00:10:57.580 --> 00:11:01.820
Such relationships were forbidden and classified
as Rassenschande (race defilement) by the

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:02.820
race laws.

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:06.150
These would have been serious enough crime
to send him to a concentration camp.

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:09.570
Thankfully, one of the police officers from
his neighborhood recognized him, and vouched

00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:10.720
for his good character.

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:14.730
He was able to get off the hook, but he had
to end his relationship, because it was far

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:16.550
too dangerous for them to be together.

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:20.440
Meanwhile, during the war, the Germans kept
African prisoners of war separate from white

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:21.440
people.

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:24.910
They were sent to a prison called Les Frontstalags,
where they were tortured and treated like

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:25.910
animals.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:29.900
The fact that Hans Massaquoi was denied entry
to the German army was a real blessing in

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:35.090
disguise, because he would never have to carry
the weight of guilt on his shoulders for participating

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:38.000
in crimes against humanity on behalf of the
Nazis.

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:41.730
Many of his close friends that he grew up
with would die in the war.

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:45.230
When the Allies were bombing Germany, Hans
and his mother had to live in hiding.

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:48.690
During the period following the Allies near
destruction of Hamburg, he befriended the

00:11:48.690 --> 00:11:53.151
family of Ralph Giordano, a half-Jewish acquaintance
of the Swing Kids jazz devotees.

00:11:53.151 --> 00:11:58.460
The Giordanos managed to survive the war by
hiding and helped Massaquoi and his mother

00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:02.170
secure a nearby basement after their Hamburg
neighborhood was destroyed.

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:05.840
Giordano, a lifelong friend, became a renowned
journalist as well.

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:09.840
In 1945, when the war was over, neither of
them had anything left.

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:13.270
Hans knew how to play the saxophone, so he
got a job playing jazz and swing music in

00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:17.080
night clubs for the American soldiers, which
supported him and his mother until they could

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:21.370
move on with their lives.

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:26.380
After The War
When World War II was over, American troops

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:30.790
were stationed in Germany, and black men entered
this all-white country once again.

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:35.630
Just like the era of the “Rhineland Bastards”,
more mixed-race babies were born when German

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:38.120
women had relationships with black soldiers.

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:41.860
Since they were fresh out of the Nazi regime,
racism was still a very powerful force in

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:42.860
Germany.

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:46.400
The vast majority of these mothers did not
want to keep their babies, and thousands of

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:48.830
mixed race children were given to orphanages.

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:52.980
Ebony Magazine brought attention to the issue
by coming out with a now-famous cover with

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:58.210
an image of a black child with bright, blue
eyes, that said; “Homes Needed For 10,000

00:12:58.210 --> 00:12:59.630
Brown Orphans.”

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:03.050
Thousands of American families stepped up
to adopt these children and bring them over

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:07.930
to the United States, but many of them remained
to start the new generation of Afro-German

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:08.930
people.

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:13.670
In 1948, Hans Massaquoi’s father, Al-Haj
was able to arrange for him to leave Germany

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:17.860
and move to Liberia, so that they could meet
each other face-to-face for the first time.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:22.210
Hans realized that while his mother had always
tried to speak well of him, his father was

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:26.670
actually rather arrogant and selfish, so they
didn’t have a very good relationship.

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:29.830
Even though he thought that Liberia was a
beautiful country, and he could have inherited

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:33.190
a crown, Hans did not want to stay there for
the rest of his life.

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:37.310
He emigrated to the United States with a student
visa, because he planned to go to college.

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:41.900
There was a mixup with the paperwork, so he
was forced to serve in the Korean War for

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:46.040
two years as a paratrooper even though he
was not an American citizen.

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:50.800
In 1950, he was finally able to start his
college classes at 24 years old, and earned

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:53.540
a journalism degree from the University of
Illinois.

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:57.310
After graduating, he worked for an African
American publication called Jet Magazine,

00:13:57.310 --> 00:14:00.700
and later moved to Chicago to work as the
editor of Ebony Magazine.

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:04.030
Hans got married and started a family of his
own in the US.

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:08.779
For years, he only told the story of his life
in Nazi Germany to his children, and only

00:14:08.779 --> 00:14:13.670
decided to write his autobiography, Destined
to Witness: Growing Up Black in Nazi Germany,

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:16.970
after he retired from his journalism career
in 1999.

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:20.940
The story of his life was shocking to a lot
of people, and it was eventually made into

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:23.330
a German movie in 2006.

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:26.120
“All’s well that ends well,” Hans Massaquoi
wrote.

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:29.410
“I’m quite satisfied with the way my life
has turned out to be.

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:32.120
I survived to tell the piece of history I
was a witness of.

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:36.340
At the same time, I wish everyone could have
a happy childhood within a fair society.

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:39.820
And that was definitely not my case.”

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:44.580
Hans Massaquoi died in 2013 on his birthday,
after turning 87 years old.

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:48.700
At the time of his death, Massaquoi was married
to the love of his life, Katharine Rousseve

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:49.700
Massaquoi.

00:14:49.700 --> 00:15:08.670
He had two sons by a previous marriage, Steve
and Hans Jr., who also survived him.

